{"overview":"ساکو چیتوزه دانش‌آموز دبیرستان فوجی‌شی، معتبرترین مدرسه در استان فوکوی، است. او در کلاس، در ورزش و در زندگی اجتماعی‌اش برجسته است و توجه‌ها را، چه مثبت و چه منفی، به خود جلب می‌کند. طبیعتاً دور او دایره‌ای از دوستانی است که هر کسی خوشحال می‌شود داشته باشد. اکنون در بهار سال دوم تحصیل، با کلاس جدید، از ساکو خواسته می‌شود به همکلاسی منزوی‌اش کمک کند تا به زندگی مدرسه بازگردد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Saku Chitose is a student at Fujishi High School, the most prestigious school in Fukui Prefecture. Outstanding in class, on the field, and in his social life, Saku attracts attention, good and bad. Naturally, he is surrounded by a circle of friends anyone would be happy to have. Now in the spring of his second year, with a new class, Saku is asked to help a shut-in classmate return to school life.","tagline_en":"","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":15,"y":2025,"poster":""},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":25,"y":2025,"poster":"/xCsz0dWkpoya5XK3y2UaEkXnin5.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":0,"y":null,"poster":"/3ojGAQXDtCjeV4ywLokkI3ftxPS.jpg"}],"episodes":25,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"坂田将吾","role":"Saku Chitose (voice)","photo":"/fRRPNBz3OCNRdmLdUTdpq7dGqxM.jpg","en":"Shogo Sakata"},{"name":"ماناکا ایوامی","role":"Yuko Hiiragi (voice)","photo":"/leKMaCBswXG8u4mfQNQ7J3y6Xow.jpg","en":"Manaka Iwami"},{"name":"羊宮妃那","role":"Yua Uchida (voice)","photo":"/tOy21NTNnKuZG48JCL673tTP16z.jpg","en":"Hina Youmiya"},{"name":"大久保瑠美","role":"Haru Aomi (voice)","photo":"/cf4cnFMllu1yO3X0gCGGDdl8GXW.jpg","en":"Rumi Okubo"},{"name":"長谷川育美","role":"Yuzuki Nanase (voice)","photo":"/aHLid4WeTafrtfqDRAZSw5K7dTj.jpg","en":"Ikumi Hasegawa"},{"name":"安済知佳","role":"Asuka Nishino (voice)","photo":"/lk3Az9O67qrXR69rctwDDHWqi9d.jpg","en":"Chika Anzai"},{"name":"阿座上洋平","role":"Kuranosuke Iwanami (voice)","photo":"/rLIqw8pIjVIxPb5engrTbu9iOex.jpg","en":"Yohei Azakami"},{"name":"宮﨑雅也","role":"Kenta Yamazaki (voice)